<title>JAPAN: Japan NCB to leave prime rate unchanged for Nov.</title>
<headline>Japan NCB to leave prime rate unchanged for Nov.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Credit Bank Ltd (NCB) said on Tuesday that it was leaving its long-term prime rate unchanged at 2.7 percent for November from the previous month, effective from Wednesday.</p>
<p>In addition, the bank will not change the coupon rate on its debentures to be issued this month, a spokesman for the bank said.</p>
<p>The November NCB debentures carry a coupon rate of 2.25 percent, he said.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8676</p>
